# Personal/dissertation files and scratch data that live in this folder but
# are not part of the deployed app -- these aren't excluded by .gitignore
# (they're untracked, not ignored), so a `vercel deploy` from the local
# working directory was bundling them into the function and blowing past
# the 225 MB serverless function size limit.
